  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(5)': Hidden Base / Systems Will Slip Through Your Fingers, Rendezvous Point, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Do or do not/There is no try, Your Insight Serves You Well; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Do or do not/There is no try' dested the Light combo Do, Or Do Not & Wise Advice (the strategy says the starting effects protect against Sense and Alter; 'There is no try' is the movie quote, and There Is No Try is a Dark card).",
  "Posted 'Coruscant(ep. 1)' dested the Light Coruscant-set system Coruscant (Light) (Coruscant); 'Tatooine' dested Tatooine (Light) (Premiere).",
  "Posted 'Wedge Antilles (or Ds2 version)' dested Wedge Antilles; the alternative is Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader.",
  "Posted 'R2-D2' dested R2-D2 (Artoo-Detoo); 'Boussh' dested Boushh; 'Lando in Falcon' dested Lando In Millennium Falcon; 'K'lor slug' dested K'lor'slug.",
  "Header lines with category counts were not cards. The strategy says to drop R2-D2 for the Hidden Base indicator system ('accidently miscounted'); the list is kept as published (60 with R2-D2)."
